OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 60s dies in flat fire
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man in his 60s has died in a fire at
OL,6,Fa flat in Greater Manchester, police
OL,7,Fhave said.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FBaguley Crescent, Middleton, at about
OL,11,F14:45 GMT on Saturday.
OL,13,FThe man died at the scene and his next
OL,14,Fof kin has been informed, a spokesman
OL,15,Ffor Greater Manchester Police said.
OL,17,FNeighbour Ian Walsh told the BBC: "The
OL,18,Ffirefighters managed to get him out and
OL,19,Fthen they did CPR on him outside the
OL,20,Fflat."
